uPlot (vendored in internal/adminui/socpage)
--------------------------------------------

The SoC and readings page embeds two files from uPlot, a charting library:
uplot.min.js (uPlot.iife.min.js) and uplot.min.css (uPlot.min.css), version
1.6.31, from https://github.com/leeoniya/uPlot, taken from the npm package
https://registry.npmjs.org/uplot/-/uplot-1.6.31.tgz (sha1
092a4b586590e9794b679e1df885a15584b03698). The files are unmodified.

